<quiz>
  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Hire purchase: hire purchase price and extra cost (INNODEMS)</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>A {@item@} has a cash price of Ksh \( {@C0@} \). On hire purchase, a customer pays a deposit of Ksh \( {@D0@} \) followed by \( {@n0@} \) monthly instalments of Ksh \( {@x0@} \) each.</p>
<p>(a) Find the hire purchase price.</p>
<div>Hire purchase price \( = \) Ksh [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</div>
<p>(b) How much more does the customer pay by buying on hire purchase instead of paying cash?</p>
<div>Extra cost \( = \) Ksh [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]</div>
<p>(c) Express the extra cost as a percentage of the cash price.</p>
<div>Extra cost \( = \) [[input:ans3]] \( \% \) of the cash price [[validation:ans3]] [[feedback:prt3]]</div>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>(a)</strong> \( H = D + x \times n = {@D0@} + {@x0@} \times {@n0@} = {@D0@} + {@x0*n0@} = {@H0@} \).</p>
<p><strong>(b)</strong> Extra cost \( = H - P = {@H0@} - {@C0@} = {@H0 - C0@} \). This is the cost of buying on credit.</p>
<p><strong>(c)</strong> \( \dfrac{H - P}{P} \times 100\% = \dfrac{ {@H0 - C0@} }{ {@C0@} } \times 100\% = {@rd(ep)@}\% \).</p>]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
    <defaultgrade>3</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.1</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
    <idnumber/>
    <stackversion>
      <text>2025010100</text>
    </stackversion>
    <questionvariables>
      <text><![CDATA[rd(v) := if integerp(v) then v else float(v);
item : rand(["television", "fridge", "laptop", "sofa set", "water pump", "cooker"]);
cands : sublist(create_list([u, w, v, ee], u, [24000, 36000, 48000, 60000, 90000], w, [10, 20, 25], v, [6, 10, 12, 15, 18], ee, [10, 15, 20, 25]),
  lambda([z], integerp((z[1]*(1 + z[4]/100) - z[1]*z[2]/100)/z[3])));
pk : rand(cands);
C0 : pk[1];
D0 : C0*pk[2]/100;
n0 : pk[3];
ep : pk[4];
H0 : C0*(1 + ep/100);
x0 : (H0 - D0)/n0;
w_nodep : x0*n0;                         /* forgot the deposit */
w_oneinst : D0 + x0;                     /* added only one instalment */
w_ofH : 100*(H0 - C0)/H0;                /* percentage of the HP price */]]></text>
    </questionvariables>
